    {
      "text": "voice of thy brother’s blood crieth unto me, Gen. 4:10. the cry of Sodom and Gomorrah is great, Gen. 18:20. Esau … cried with a great and exceeding bitter cry, Gen. 27:34. Joseph … cried, Cause every man to go out from me, Gen. 45:1. they cried, and their cry came up unto God, Ex. 2:23. heard their cry by reason of their taskmasters, Ex. 3:7. If … they cry at all unto me, I will surely hear their cry, Ex. 22:23. Elijah mocked them, and said, Cry aloud, 1 Kgs. 18:27. They cried, but there was none to save them, Ps. 18:41. I have cried day and night before thee, Ps. 88:1. they cried unto the Lord in their trouble, Ps. 107:6. In my distress I cried unto the Lord, Ps. 120:1. looked for … righteousness, but behold a cry, Isa. 5:7 (2 Ne. 15:7). voice of him that crieth in the wilderness, Isa. 40:3 (Matt. 3:3; Mark 1:3; Luke 3:4; John 1:23). He shall not cry, Isa. 42:2 (Matt. 12:19). though they shall cry unto me, Jer. 11:11. go to Nineveh … and cry against it, Jonah 1:2. how long shall I cry, and thou wilt not hear, Hab. 1:2.",
